  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 508.01 Application, Data Required",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 508.01 Application, Data Required.\n\n(a) Each applicant for an initial or vanity registration shall submit the following to the department:\n\n(1) A completed “Application for Vanity Plates” form RDMV 120 (rev. 1/20) containing the requested combination of characters for the initial or vanity registration plate;\n\n(2) A completed application for registration, or current valid registration; and\n\n(3) The plate manufacturing fee required by RSA 261:75, and also the prorated by month portion of the special vanity plate service fee required by RSA 261:89 for the remainder of registration period.\n\nSource. #7972, eff 10-17-03 (See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Saf-C 500); ss by #9995, INTERIM, eff 9-17-11, EXPIRED: 3-15-12\n\nNew. #10135, eff 5-23-12; ss by #10769, eff 1-21-15; ss by #12581, eff 7-20-18; ss by #13521, eff 1-13-23 (formerly Saf-C 509.01); ss by #14504, EMERGENCY, eff 2-6-26, EXPIRED: 8-5-26; reverted back to #13521",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c500.html"
